To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

In order to use your NEIGHCRYS output files as DMACRYS input, add a line 'ACCM 100000000' after the CHGC line, change the STAR PLUT line to STAR PROP and remove the NOPR line

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < CBMZPN_opt_III.dmain > CBMZPN_opt_III.dmaout

To postprocess the DMACRYS result on Xenon, type
   /home/cposs/bin/FvibSetup_DMACRYS.pl < CBMZPN_opt_III.dmaout > fort.10
   /home/cposs/bin/elastphon.out
